  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>New Shadow Style — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p>Finally, at 18th level, you manage to reach the peak of New Shadow Style. Your <em>Simple Domain</em> gains the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><em>Simple Domain</em> costs no cursed energy.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can freely move and maintain <em>Simple Domain.</em>  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The range of any of New Shadow Style techniques can be increased to up to 60 feet as a bonus action until the end of your turn</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When you expand the range of your <em>Simple Domain</em> over a creature, you can make two weapon attacks against a single creature as a free action (regardless of range). You can do this a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus each long rest.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
